    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the vents are clear and the thermostat is fine. i checked the ducts in the attic and they dont look damaged or anything. it feels like the air is just... disappearing before it even gets into the room. is there anything else that could be causing air to just not make it where it's supposed to go?",
